  "summary": "Senior Software Engineer with 10+ years of experience building, rebuilding, and owning production software across desktop, web, mobile, embedded, and industrial environments.\n\nPrimarily focused on C#/.NET, WPF, ASP.NET Core, SQL Server, APIs, networking, and production systems. My experience spans the full software lifecycle—from architecture and database design through deployment, troubleshooting, performance optimization, and long-term production support.\n\nI’ve rebuilt and scaled an industrial software platform from roughly 20 to 400+ concurrent machine connections and developed software used by major manufacturing customers worldwide. I also built and operated a SaaS platform that grew to 20,000+ users.\n\nB.S. in Computer Science with a minor in Mathematics from the University of North Carolina at Charlotte.",
